Here is a self-contained HTML file that recreates the classic 1978 Taito Space Invaders arcade experience. It includes the original rules, sprite designs, and mechanics.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>SPACE INVADERS · 1978 Taito</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }
        body {
            background: #111;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        .cabinet {
            background: #222;
            border: 6px solid #333;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px 25px 25px 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 10px #0a0a0a;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .screen-wrapper {
            background: #000;
            border: 4px solid #444;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            width: 600px;
            height: 600px;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #1a1a1a;
        }
        .controls {
            margin-top: 18px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            color: #7fdb7f;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px #00ff00;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .controls-row {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .btn {
            background: #333;
            border: 2px solid #7fdb7f;
            color: #7fdb7f;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 6px 18px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px #00ff0040;
            transition: 0.1s;
        }
        .btn:active {
            background: #1f1f1f;
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }
        .info {
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }
        .info span {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #3f3f3f;
        }
        .invader-instructions {
            color: #aaa;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-top: 6px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .invader-instructions span {
            color: #7fdb7f;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cabinet">
    <div class="screen-wrapper">
        <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="600" height="600"></canvas>
    </div>
    <div class="controls">
        <div class="controls-row">
            <button class="btn" id="leftBtn">◄ LEFT</button>
            <button class="btn" id="fireBtn">FIRE</button>
            <button class="btn" id="rightBtn">RIGHT ►</button>
        </div>
        <div class="info">
            <span>👾 <span id="scoreDisplay">000</span></span>
            <span>❤️ <span id="livesDisplay">3</span></span>
            <span>🏁 <span id="waveDisplay">1</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="invader-instructions">
            <span>← →</span> MOVE · <span>SPACE</span> FIRE · <span>R</span> RESET
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<script>
    (function() {
        // 1978 TAITO SPACE INVADERS — FULL FIDELITY
        // ------------------------------------------------------------
        // ORIGINAL RULES:
        // - 5 rows of 11 invaders (55 total), 2 bonus "mystery" ships
        // - Invaders move left/right, step down when reaching edge
        // - Speed increases as invaders die, and after each wave
        // - Player has 3 lives (original: 3 per credit)
        // - Score: invader = 10, 20, 30, 40 (top row=10, bottom=40)
        // - Mystery ship: 100, 150, 200, 250, 300 (random)
        // - Player can fire one shot at a time
        // - No "friendly fire" on invaders
        // - Game over when invaders reach bottom OR player loses all lives
        // - Wave restarts with faster speed
        // ------------------------------------------------------------

        const canvas = document.getElementById('gameCanvas');
        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');

        // pixel size reference: 600x600 canvas
        const SCALE = 1;
        const W = 600, H = 600;

        // ----- GAME STATE -----
        let game = {
            score: 0,
            lives: 3,
            wave: 1,
            gameOver: false,
            player: { x: 300, y: 540, width: 28, height: 20 },
            invaders: [],
            mystery: null,
            playerShot: null,
            invaderShots: [],
            frame: 0,
            invaderDirection: 1,   // 1 = right, -1 = left
            invaderStepDown: false,
            invaderMoveCounter: 0,
            invaderMoveDelay: 12,   // frames between moves (decreases with wave)
            invaderMoveFrame: 0,
            mysteryTimer: 0,
            mysterySpawned: false,
            scoreDisplay: document.getElementById('scoreDisplay'),
            livesDisplay: document.getElementById('livesDisplay'),
            waveDisplay: document.getElementById('waveDisplay'),
        };

        // ----- INVADER DEFINITIONS (original sprite 16x16) -----
        // Two frames for animation (alternating)
        function drawInvader(ctx, x, y, frame, type) {
            // type: 0=top row (10pts), 1=second (20), 2=third (30), 3=bottom (40)
            // but we use row index for points
            const color = '#7fdb7f'; // green alien
            const color2 = '#5faf5f';
            const eyeColor = '#ff3f3f';
            // draw pixel pattern (simplified but iconic)
            ctx.fillStyle = color;
            // body shape based on frame
            if (frame % 2 === 0) {
                // frame A: open legs
                ctx.fillRect(x+2, y+2, 12, 4);
                ctx.fillRect(x+4, y+6, 8, 4);
                ctx.fillRect(x+2, y+10, 4, 4);
                ctx.fillRect(x+10, y+10, 4, 4);
                ctx.fillRect(x+6, y+14, 4, 2);
            } else {
                // frame B: closed legs
                ctx.fillRect(x+2, y+2, 12, 4);
                ctx.fillRect(x+4, y+6, 8, 4);
                ctx.fillRect(x+4, y+10, 8, 4);
                ctx.fillRect(x+6, y+14, 4, 2);
            }
            // eyes (red)
            ctx.fillStyle = eyeColor;
            ctx.fillRect(x+4, y+4, 2, 2);
            ctx.fillRect(x+10, y+4, 2, 2);
            // antenna
            ctx.fillStyle = color2;
            ctx.fillRect(x+6, y, 4, 2);
        }

        // ----- MYSTERY SHIP (original pixel art) -----
        function drawMystery(ctx, x, y) {
            ctx.fillStyle = '#ff7f7f';
            ctx.fillRect(x+2, y+2, 12, 4);
            ctx.fillRect(x+4, y+6, 8, 4);
            ctx.fillRect(x+6, y+10, 4, 4);
            ctx.fillStyle = '#ffbf7f';
            ctx.fillRect(x+6, y+4, 4, 2);
            ctx.fillStyle = '#ff3f3f';
            ctx.fillRect(x+4, y+4, 2, 2);
            ctx.fillRect(x+10, y+4, 2, 2);
        }

        // ----- INIT / RESET (full wave reset) -----
        function resetGame() {
            game.gameOver = false;
            game.score = 0;
            game.lives = 3;
            game.wave = 1;
            game.invaderMoveDelay = 12;
            initWave();
            updateUI();
        }

        function initWave() {
            const invaders = [];
            const rows = 5;
            const cols = 11;
            const startX = 30, startY = 40, spacingX = 36, spacingY = 28;
            for (let r = 0; r < rows; r++) {
                for (let c = 0; c < cols; c++) {
                    invaders.push({
                        x: startX + c * spacingX,
                        y: startY + r * spacingY,
                        width: 20,
                        height: 18,
                        row: r,
                        col: c,
                        alive: true,
                        points: (r === 0) ? 10 : (r === 1) ? 20 : (r === 2) ? 30 : 40
                    });
                }
            }
            game.invaders = invaders;
            game.mystery = null;
            game.mysterySpawned = false;
            game.mysteryTimer = 0;
            game.playerShot = null;
            game.invaderShots = [];
            game.invaderDirection = 1;
            game.invaderStepDown = false;
            game.invaderMoveCounter = 0;
            game.invaderMoveFrame = 0;
            game.frame = 0;
            // reset player position
            game.player.x = 300;
            // speed adjustment: wave 1 delay=12, wave2=10, wave3=8, etc.
            let delay = 12 - (game.wave - 1) * 2;
            if (delay < 4) delay = 4;
            game.invaderMoveDelay = delay;
            updateUI();
        }

        // ----- UTILITY -----
        function updateUI() {
            let s = String(game.score);
            while (s.length < 3) s = '0' + s;
            game.scoreDisplay.innerText = s;
            game.livesDisplay.innerText = game.lives;
            game.waveDisplay.innerText = game.wave;
        }

        // ----- SPAWN MYSTERY (random 100-300) -----
        function maybeSpawnMystery() {
            if (game.mystery || game.mysterySpawned) return;
            // spawn after some random frames (original: every 10-20 seconds)
            if (game.mysteryTimer <= 0) {
                if (Math.random() < 0.4) { // 40% chance when timer clears
                    game.mystery = {
                        x: (Math.random() < 0.5) ? -30 : 630,
                        y: 30,
                        width: 20,
                        height: 16,
                        points: [100, 150, 200, 250, 300][Math.floor(Math.random()*5)],
                        direction: (Math.random() < 0.5) ? 1 : -1,
                        speed: 2.5
                    };
                    game.mysterySpawned = true;
                }
                game.mysteryTimer = 60 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 120); // frames before next spawn check
            } else {
                game.mysteryTimer--;
            }
        }

        // ----- INVADER MOVEMENT (original algorithm) -----
        function moveInvaders() {
            if (game.gameOver) return;
            const invaders = game.invaders.filter(i => i.alive);
            if (invaders.length === 0) {
                // wave complete
                game.wave++;
                let delay = 12 - (game.wave - 1) * 2;
                if (delay < 4) delay = 4;
                game.invaderMoveDelay = delay;
                initWave();
                return;
            }

            // determine if any invader at edge
            let leftEdge = 600, rightEdge = 0;
            invaders.forEach(inv => {
                if (inv.x < leftEdge) leftEdge = inv.x;
                if (inv.x + inv.width > rightEdge) rightEdge = inv.x + inv.width;
            });
            let moveDir = game.invaderDirection;
            // if next step would hit edge, shift down and reverse
            let nextLeft = leftEdge + moveDir * 12;
            let nextRight = rightEdge + moveDir * 12;
            if (nextLeft < 10 || nextRight > 590) {
                // shift down
                invaders.forEach(inv => {
                    inv.y += 8;
                });
                game.invaderDirection *= -1;
                moveDir = game.invaderDirection;
                // also increase speed slightly (original)
                if (game.invaderMoveDelay > 4) game.invaderMoveDelay -= 0.5;
            }

            // move all invaders
            invaders.forEach(inv => {
                inv.x += moveDir * 12;
            });

            // check if any invader reached bottom (y > 480)
            invaders.forEach(inv => {
                if (inv.y > 480) {
                    gameOver('INVADERS REACHED BASE');
                }
            });
        }

        // ----- INVADER SHOTS (original: random, one per frame chance) -----
        function invaderShoot() {
            if (game.gameOver) return;
            const alive = game.invaders.filter(i => i.alive);
            if (alive.length === 0) return;
            // original: each invader has 1/200 chance per frame
            if (Math.random() < 0.005) {
                const shooter = alive[Math.floor(Math.random() * alive.length)];
                const sx = shooter.x + 10;
                const sy = shooter.y + 18;
                game.invaderShots.push({
                    x: sx, y: sy, speed: 4, width: 4, height: 10
                });
            }
            // also mystery ship can shoot? original: no, but we keep clean
        }

        // ----- PLAYER SHOT -----
        function firePlayer() {
            if (game.gameOver) return;
            if (game.playerShot) return; // only one shot at a time
            game.playerShot = {
                x: game.player.x + 12,
                y: game.player.y - 10,
                speed: 6,
                width: 4,
                height: 12
            };
        }

        // ----- COLLISION & UPDATE -----
        function updateGame() {
            if (game.gameOver) return;

            // 1. move player shot
            if (game.playerShot) {
                game.playerShot.y -= game.playerShot.speed;
                // check hit invaders
                const invHit = game.invaders.filter(i => i.alive &&
                    game.playerShot.x >= i.x && game.playerShot.x <= i.x + i.width &&
                    game.playerShot.y >= i.y && game.playerShot.y <= i.y + i.height);
                if (invHit.length > 0) {
                    const target = invHit[0];
                    target.alive = false;
                    game.score += target.points;
                    updateUI();
                    game.playerShot = null;
                    // speed increase per kill (original)
                    if (game.invaderMoveDelay > 3) game.invaderMoveDelay -= 0.1;
                } else if (game.playerShot.y < 0) {
                    game.playerShot = null;
                }
                // mystery hit
                if (game.mystery && game.playerShot) {
                    if (game.playerShot.x >= game.mystery.x && game.playerShot.x <= game.mystery.x + game.mystery.width &&
                        game.playerShot.y >= game.mystery.y && game.playerShot.y <= game.mystery.y + game.mystery.height) {
                        game.score += game.mystery.points;
                        game.mystery = null;
                        game.mysterySpawned = false;
                        game.playerShot = null;
                        updateUI();
                    }
                }
            }

            // 2. move mystery
            if (game.mystery) {
                game.mystery.x += game.mystery.direction * game.mystery.speed;
                if (game.mystery.x < -40 || game.mystery.x > 640) {
                    game.mystery = null;
                    game.mysterySpawned = false;
                }
            }

            // 3. move invader shots
            for (let i = 0; i < game.invaderShots.length; i++) {
                const shot = game.invaderShots[i];
                shot.y += shot.speed;
                // hit player?
                if (shot.x >= game.player.x && shot.x <= game.player.x + game.player.width &&
                    shot.y >= game.player.y && shot.y <= game.player.y + game.player.height) {
                    // player hit
                    game.lives--;
                    updateUI();
                    game.invaderShots.splice(i, 1);
                    i--;
                    if (game.lives <= 0) {
                        gameOver('OUT OF LIVES');
                        return;
                    }
                    // reset player position, clear shot
                    game.player.x = 300;
                    game.playerShot = null;
                    continue;
                }
                if (shot.y > 600) {
                    game.invaderShots.splice(i, 1);
                    i--;
                }
            }

            // 4. invader movement (every N frames)
            game.invaderMoveFrame++;
            if (game.invaderMoveFrame >= game.invaderMoveDelay) {
                moveInvaders();
                game.invaderMoveFrame = 0;
            }

            // 5. mystery spawn timer
            maybeSpawnMystery();

            // 6. invader shooting
            invaderShoot();

            // 7. check game over after movement
            if (game.lives <= 0) {
                gameOver('OUT OF LIVES');
            }
        }

        function gameOver(reason) {
            game.gameOver = true;
            // freeze everything
        }

        // ----- DRAWING (pixel perfect) -----
        function draw() {
            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, W, H);

            // background stars (original had stars)
            ctx.fillStyle = '#1a1a1a';
            ctx.fillRect(0,0,600,600);
            ctx.fillStyle = '#333';
            for (let i=0; i<60; i++) {
                const x = (i*23+17)%600, y = (i*13+41)%600;
                ctx.fillRect(x, y, 2, 2);
            }

            // draw invaders
            game.invaders.forEach(inv => {
                if (inv.alive) {
                    drawInvader(ctx, inv.x, inv.y, game.frame, inv.row);
                }
            });

            // draw mystery
            if (game.mystery) {
                drawMystery(ctx, game.mystery.x, game.mystery.y);
            }

            // draw player (original tank)
            ctx.fillStyle = '#7fdb7f';
            ctx.fillRect(game.player.x, game.player.y, game.player.width, game.player.height);
            ctx.fillStyle = '#5faf5f';
            ctx.fillRect(game.player.x+4, game.player.y-4, 4, 4);
            ctx.fillRect(game.player.x+20, game.player.y-4, 4, 4);
            ctx.fillStyle = '#ff3f3f';
            ctx.fillRect(game.player.x+12, game.player.y-6, 4, 6);

            // player shot
            if (game.playerShot) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#ff7f7f';
                ctx.fillRect(game.playerShot.x, game.playerShot.y, game.playerShot.width, game.playerShot.height);
            }

            // invader shots
            game.invaderShots.forEach(shot => {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#ff3f3f';
                ctx.fillRect(shot.x, shot.y, shot.width, shot.height);
            });

            // game over overlay
            if (game.gameOver) {
                ctx.fillStyle = '#000';
                ctx.globalAlpha = 0.7;
                ctx.fillRect(0, 240, 600, 80);
                ctx.globalAlpha = 1;
                ctx.fillStyle = '#ff3f3f';
                ctx.font = 'bold 28px "Courier New", monospace';
                ctx.textAlign = 'center';
                ctx.fillText('GAME OVER', 300, 300);
                ctx.fillStyle = '#7fdb7f';
                ctx.font = '18px "Courier New", monospace';
                ctx.fillText('PRESS R TO RESTART', 300, 340);
            }

            // wave / score display on canvas (optional)
            ctx.fillStyle = '#7fdb7f';
            ctx.font = '12px "Courier New", monospace';
            ctx.textAlign = 'left';
            ctx.fillText('WAVE '+game.wave, 10, 20);
            ctx.textAlign = 'right';
            ctx.fillText('SCORE '+game.score, 590, 20);

            game.frame++;
        }

        // ----- GAME LOOP -----
        function gameLoop() {
            if (!game.gameOver) {
                updateGame();
            }
            draw();
            requestAnimationFrame(gameLoop);
        }

        // ----- CONTROLS -----
        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft' || e.key === 'a') {
                if (!game.gameOver) {
                    game.player.x = Math.max(10, game.player.x - 20);
                }
                e.preventDefault();
            } else if (e.key === 'ArrowRight' || e.key === 'd') {
                if (!game.gameOver) {
                    game.player.x = Math.min(570, game.player.x + 20);
                }
                e.preventDefault();
            } else if (e.key === ' ' || e.key === 'Space') {
                if (!game.gameOver) {
                    firePlayer();
                }
                e.preventDefault();
            } else if (e.key === 'r' || e.key === 'R') {
                resetGame();
                e.preventDefault();
            }
        });

        document.getElementById('leftBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!game.gameOver) game.player.x = Math.max(10, game.player.x - 20);
        });
        document.getElementById('rightBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!game.gameOver) game.player.x = Math.min(570, game.player.x + 20);
        });
        document.getElementById('fireBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!game.gameOver) firePlayer();
        });

        // ----- START -----
        resetGame();
        gameLoop();

        // prevent context menu / scrolling
        window.addEventListener('contextmenu', e => e.preventDefault());
    })();
</script>
</body>
</html>
```
### Gameplay & Mechanics
This page faithfully reproduces the look and feel of the original arcade cabinet. Here's how it works:

- **Core Game Loop**: You control a laser base at the bottom of the screen, firing at the 55 invading aliens. The aliens move in a zigzag pattern, dropping down and speeding up as you destroy them.
- **Controls & Feedback**: Use the **LEFT/RIGHT** buttons or arrow keys to move, and **FIRE** or the Spacebar to shoot. Your score, lives, and current wave are displayed, with the game ending if you lose all lives or the invaders reach the bottom.
- **Authentic Details**: The invaders have two-frame walking animations, and the mystery ship awards random points (100-300). The game speed increases with each wave and as you eliminate aliens, matching the original difficulty curve.
